{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-amali-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"amali-island","about":"Embark on a journey to Amali Island in The World Islands Dubai. This unique destination, crafted by Amali Properties, introduces the extraordinary Amali Island Beachfront Villas, offering an unparalleled living experience. Amali Island, known as one of the world islands, represents a pinnacle of engineering, connecting two islands in a display of architectural mastery. Within this iconic development, Amali Island presents 24 ultra-luxury, 5 to 7 bedroom villas, each designed to embody the essence of coastal elegance. Thanks to a partnership with ELASTIC, the Amali Island villas showcase a harmonious blend of design and natural beauty, offering two distinct yet seamless facades.The interiors, envisioned by Hirsch Bedner Associates (HBA), reflect a diverse range of global aesthetics, with each villa on the world islands boasting materials sourced from across the globe. HBA's detailed research ensures that every aspect of the interiors aligns with Amali Island's natural setting. Complementing this, Amali Properties' commitment to sustainability is evident in their collaboration with SquareM, designing tranquil spaces for relaxation on Amali Island in The World Islands Dubai.","price":44750000,"title":"Amali Island","bitrix":{"id":318,"pf_id":"are.2.13905","source":null,"project_id":"Amali Island","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Amali Island","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Amali Properties","project_location":"The World Islands"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/amali_island_feature_2107894a63.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/amali_island_feature_2107894a63.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.205033,"lng":55.169798},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.clo